       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHAREDWK.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 WORK-REQUEST.
   05 INPUT-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 INPUT-COUNT PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
   05 INPUT-RATE PIC 9V99.
01 WORK-RESULT PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WORK-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WORK-REQUEST WORK-RESULT WORK-STATUS.
MAIN-WORKER.
    MOVE ZERO TO WORK-RESULT WORK-STATUS.
    PERFORM CHECK-REQUEST.
    IF WORK-STATUS = ZERO
        PERFORM CALCULATE-RESULT
    END-IF.
    IF WORK-STATUS NOT = ZERO
        MOVE ZERO TO WORK-RESULT
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
CHECK-REQUEST.
    CALL 'INPUTCHK' USING BY CONTENT INPUT-AMOUNT
        BY VALUE INPUT-COUNT
        BY REFERENCE WORK-STATUS
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 95 TO WORK-STATUS
    END-CALL.
CALCULATE-RESULT.
    CALL 'RATESTEP' USING BY CONTENT WORK-REQUEST
        BY REFERENCE WORK-RESULT WORK-STATUS
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 96 TO WORK-STATUS
            MOVE ZERO TO WORK-RESULT
    END-CALL.
